mc:wmk2006 a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    dc:description "A hierarchical classification of meteorites into chondrites, primitive achondrites and achondrites, subdivided by class, clan, group and subgroup on the basis of mineralogy, petrography, bulk chemistry and oxygen-isotope systematics."@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Weisberg M. K., McCoy T. J., and Krot A. N. (2006) Systematics and Evaluation of Meteorite Classification. In Meteorites and the Early Solar System II (D. S. Lauretta and H. Y. McSween Jr., eds.), pp. 19-52. University of Arizona Press, Tucson."@en ;
